    "long_instructions": "## Shopping Cart Calculator\r\n\r\nCreate a program that helps a shopper understand the cost of items in their cart. Choose the items, their prices, and what useful cost information your program will calculate.\r\n\r\n### Build Your Program\r\n\r\nYour program must:\r\n\r\n* Store shopping information in variables and a numeric list\r\n* Access at least two list elements and use them in an expression\r\n* Calculate information about the cost of the cart\r\n* Build and print a message that includes the result\r\n\r\nRun your program and fix any errors. Then ask AI Tutor to review it against the requirements and make any final changes yourself.\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help? Ask AI Tutor]\r\n\r\nYou can ask AI Tutor to help you:\r\n\r\n* Decide what shopping information to store\r\n* Brainstorm useful cost information to calculate\r\n* Check whether your plan meets the requirements\r\n* Give you a hint about a specific part of your code\r\n* Explain an error message\r\n\r\nAsk for guidance or hints, but write the program yourself.\r\n\r\n:::",
